---
// Opt-in Form for Zoho CRM Checklist
---

<div class="optin-card">
  <p class="eyebrow">Kostenlos</p>
  <h3>Die ultimative Zoho-CRM-Checkliste für KMUs</h3>
  <p>Erhalten Sie unsere bewährte Checkliste – perfekt für den Einstieg in Zoho CRM. Tragt euch ein und ladet sie direkt herunter.</p>
  
  <div class="sneak-peeks-container">
    <div class="sneak-peeks-logo">
      <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="kloseup – Startseite" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/Klosestral/logos/Logo_mit_Text.svg" alt="kloseup" class="logo-img" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="sneak-peeks-center">
      <h3>Sneak Peaks</h3>
      <ul class="peek-list">
        <li>Prozessanalyse & Zieldefinition</li>
        <li>Schritt-für-Schritt CRM-Einrichtung</li>
        <li>Datenmigration aus Alt-Systemen</li>
        <li>Automatisierungen für Vertrieb & Service</li>
        <li>Integration mit E-Mail & Kalender</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="optin-form-wrapper">
      <form id="optin-form" class="optin-form" action="#" method="POST">
        <div class="optin-group">
          <label for="optin-email" class="optin-label">E-Mail-Adresse</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="optin-email"
            name="email"
            class="optin-input"
            placeholder="ihre@email.at"
            required
          />
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn optin-btn">
          <span class="btn-text">Checkliste herunterladen</span>
          <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="optin-success" class="optin-success" style="display: none;">
    <p class="optin-success-msg">Vielen Dank! Hier können Sie die Checkliste herunterladen:</p>
    <a href="/Zoho CRM Checkliste _ Kloseup.pdf" class="btn btn-download" download>
      <span class="btn-text">PDF herunterladen</span>
      <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .optin-card {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
  }
  .optin-card > p.eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .optin-card > h3 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .optin-card > p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .sneak-peeks-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sneak-peeks-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .sneak-peeks-logo .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .sneak-peeks-logo .logo-img {
    width: auto;
    height: clamp(26.4px, 2.86vw, 37.4px);
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .sneak-peeks-center {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .sneak-peeks-center h3 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .peek-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .optin-form-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .peek-list li {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    padding-left: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .peek-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--green-bright);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .optin-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .optin-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .optin-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .optin-input {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .optin-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--green-bright);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(76, 140, 107, 0.15);
  }
  .optin-input::placeholder {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .optin-btn {
    background: var(--green-deep);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .15s, transform .15s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .optin-btn:hover {
    background: var(--green-bright);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .optin-success {
    margin-top: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-out;
  }
  .optin-success-msg {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .btn-download {
    background: var(--green-deep);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .15s, transform .15s;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .btn-download:hover {
    background: var(--green-bright);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .optin-card {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('optin-form').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const email = document.getElementById('optin-email').value.trim();
    const emailRegex = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/;
    
    if (email && emailRegex.test(email)) {
      // In a real implementation, you would send the email to your backend
      // For now, just show the download link
      document.getElementById('optin-form').style.display = 'none';
      document.getElementById('optin-success').style.display = 'block';
    } else {
      alert('Bitte geben Sie eine gültige E-Mail-Adresse ein.');
    }
  });
</script>
